are grid: $\overrightarrow{OA}=\mathbf{a}$, $\overrightarrow{OB}=\mathbf{b}$, and $\overrightarrow{OC}=\mathbf{c}$.

![Vector diagram](images/a4/a4e7fa23be759035d5765a80ed9d78b7fb7be560ec38fd24aedc172abd2b0b99.png)

Given that $\mathbf{c}=\lambda\mathbf{a}+\mu\mathbf{b}$, find $\lambda$ and $\mu$.

$\lambda=$ {{field-1}}

$\mu=$ {{field-2}}"] [:db/add "dd30c11b-b5c7-5075-8cd9-10d8eaf23ea0" :question/worked-solution "![Completed vector route](images/9b/9b7f2c9f69c8d8661ec513da0e8a3d0a8a7eb31d2826162aab0a2267ff659425.png)

Construct the route $O\to X\to C$, first parallel to $\mathbf{a}$ and then parallel to $\mathbf{b}$.

Along $OX$, move $2$ squares left and $2$ squares down. A copy of $\mathbf{a}$ moves $1$ square right and $1$ square up. Thus $OX=2|\mathbf{a}|$ and the segment points in the opposite direction to $\mathbf{a}$. Hence $\overrightarrow{OX}=-2\mathbf{a}$.

Along $XC$, move $9$ squares right and $6$ squares up. A copy of $\mathbf{b}$ moves $3$ squares right and $2$ squares up. Thus $XC=3|\mathbf{b}|$ and the segment points in the same direction to $\mathbf{b}$. Hence $\overrightarrow{XC}=3\mathbf{b}$.

$$
\begin{aligned}
\mathbf{c}&=\overrightarrow{OX}+\overrightarrow{XC}\\&=-2\mathbf{a}+3\mathbf{b}
\end{aligned}
$$

Since $\mathbf{a}$ and $\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, their coefficients are unique. Matching coefficients gives $\lambda=-2$ and $\mu=3$."] [:db/add "dd30c11b-b5c7-5075-8cd9-10d8eaf23ea0" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "dd30c11b-b5c7-5075-8cd9-10d8eaf23ea0" :question/answer-fields "ae3042e4-abbe-5130-aa21-f26f8c8b01c8"] [:db/add "dd30c11b-b5c7-5075-8cd9-10d8eaf23ea0" :question/answer-fields "50b7d522-b38d-5763-91fe-154a18de07ee"] [:db/ensure "dd30c11b-b5c7-5075-8cd9-10d8eaf23ea0" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096652 :knowledge-point/questions "dd30c11b-b5c7-5075-8cd9-10d8eaf23ea0"] [:db/add "06e62fa1-b0d8-5e1d-a594-9813aae0ad1a" :answer/id #uuid "06e62fa1-b0d8-5e1d-a594-9813aae0ad1a"] [:db/add "06e62fa1-b0d8-5e1d-a594-9813aae0ad1a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "06e62fa1-b0d8-5e1d-a594-9813aae0ad1a" :answer/value "2"] [:db/ensure "06e62fa1-b0d8-5e1d-a594-9813aae0ad1a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "97ba730e-6f70-5215-b92b-c00efe014214" :answer-field/id #uuid "97ba730e-6f70-5215-b92b-c00efe014214"] [:db/add "97ba730e-6f70-5215-b92b-c00efe014214" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "97ba730e-6f70-5215-b92b-c00efe014214" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "97ba730e-6f70-5215-b92b-c00efe014214" :answer-field/choices "06e62fa1-b0d8-5e1d-a594-9813aae0ad1a"] [:db/add "97ba730e-6f70-5215-b92b-c00efe014214" :answer-field/correct "06e62fa1-b0d8-5e1d-a594-9813aae0ad1a"] [:db/ensure "97ba730e-6f70-5215-b92b-c00efe014214" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "b8962b24-6192-5520-881d-4f719da6e48f" :answer/id #uuid "b8962b24-6192-5520-881d-4f719da6e48f"] [:db/add "b8962b24-6192-5520-881d-4f719da6e48f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b8962b24-6192-5520-881d-4f719da6e48f" :answer/value "-2"] [:db/ensure "b8962b24-6192-5520-881d-4f719da6e48f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4a2d44a0-d869-5067-9dc6-525d01e437f1" :answer-field/id #uuid "4a2d44a0-d869-5067-9dc6-525d01e437f1"] [:db/add "4a2d44a0-d869-5067-9dc6-525d01e437f1"