Construct the route $O\to X\to C$, first parallel to $\mathbf{a}$ and then parallel to $\mathbf{b}$.

Along $OX$, move $2$ squares left and $4$ squares down. A copy of $\mathbf{a}$ moves $1$ square left and $2$ squares down. Thus $OX=2|\mathbf{a}|$ and the segment points in the same direction to $\mathbf{a}$. Hence $\overrightarrow{OX}=2\mathbf{a}$.

Along $XC$, move $2$ squares right and $2$ squares up. A copy of $\mathbf{b}$ moves $1$ square left and $1$ square down. Thus $XC=2|\mathbf{b}|$ and the segment points in the opposite direction to $\mathbf{b}$. Hence $\overrightarrow{XC}=-2\mathbf{b}$.

$$
\begin{aligned}
\mathbf{c}&=\overrightarrow{OX}+\overrightarrow{XC}\\&=2\mathbf{a}-2\mathbf{b}
\end{aligned}
$$

Since $\mathbf{a}$ and $\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, their coefficients are unique. Matching coefficients gives $\lambda=2$ and $\mu=-2$."] [:db/add "daa4a0cd-86e7-5a53-96e6-930d96121747" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "daa4a0cd-86e7-5a53-96e6-930d96121747" :question/answer-fields "97ba730e-6f70-5215-b92b-c00efe014214"] [:db/add "daa4a0cd-86e7-5a53-96e6-930d96121747" :question/answer-fields "4a2d44a0-d869-5067-9dc6-525d01e437f1"] [:db/ensure "daa4a0cd-86e7-5a53-96e6-930d96121747" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096652 :knowledge-point/questions "daa4a0cd-86e7-5a53-96e6-930d96121747"] [:db/add "4cee560a-717f-516f-921b-d306b6669a2a" :answer/id #uuid "4cee560a-717f-516f-921b-d306b6669a2a"] [:db/add "4cee560a-717f-516f-921b-d306b6669a2a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4cee560a-717f-516f-921b-d306b6669a2a" :answer/value "-3"] [:db/ensure "4cee560a-717f-516f-921b-d306b6669a2a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a779b0a7-8425-5967-bfea-53aaa14a0f77" :answer-field/id #uuid "a779b0a7-8425-5967-bfea-53aaa14a0f77"] [:db/add "a779b0a7-8425-5967-bfea-53aaa14a0f77" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "a779b0a7-8425-5967-bfea-53aaa14a0f77" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "a779b0a7-8425-5967-bfea-53aaa14a0f77" :answer-field/choices "4cee560a-717f-516f-921b-d306b6669a2a"] [:db/add "a779b0a7-8425-5967-bfea-53aaa14a0f77" :answer-field/correct "4cee560a-717f-516f-921b-d306b6669a2a"] [:db/ensure "a779b0a7-8425-5967-bfea-53aaa14a0f77" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "153120c8-35a6-557b-b67b-c99479f7b7bb" :answer/id #uuid "153120c8-35a6-557b-b67b-c99479f7b7bb"] [:db/add "153120c8-35a6-557b-b67b-c99479f7b7bb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "153120c8-35a6-557b-b67b-c99479f7b7bb" :answer/value "-2"] [:db/ensure "153120c8-35a6-557b-b67b-c99479f7b7bb" :answer/validate] [:db/add "62e0303d-0d43-5fec-8fff-251b531d13be" :answer-field/id #uuid "62e0303d-0d43-5fec-8fff-251b531d13be"] [:db/add "62e0303d-0d43-5fec-8fff-251b531d13be