Given that $\mathbf{c}=\lambda\mathbf{a}+\mu\mathbf{b}$, find $\lambda$ and $\mu$.

$\lambda=$ {{field-1}}

$\mu=$ {{field-2}}"] [:db/add "6adb066b-ffdb-5044-8b11-d0799ecdd208" :question/worked-solution "![Completed vector route](images/03/03ced4f79d7a92dea3de200bb8ea9e59c84dc8b76cfb0e66f1ef8626df167bd7.png)

Construct the route $O\to X\to C$, first parallel to $\mathbf{b}$ and then parallel to $\mathbf{a}$.

Along $OX$, move $4$ squares left and $4$ squares up. A copy of $\mathbf{b}$ moves $2$ squares right and $2$ squares down. Thus $OX=2|\mathbf{b}|$ and the segment points in the opposite direction to $\mathbf{b}$. Hence $\overrightarrow{OX}=-2\mathbf{b}$.

Along $XC$, move $6$ squares left and $3$ squares up. A copy of $\mathbf{a}$ moves $2$ squares right and $1$ square down. Thus $XC=3|\mathbf{a}|$ and the segment points in the opposite direction to $\mathbf{a}$. Hence $\overrightarrow{XC}=-3\mathbf{a}$.

$$
\begin{aligned}
\mathbf{c}&=\overrightarrow{OX}+\overrightarrow{XC}\\&=-2\mathbf{b}-3\mathbf{a}\\&=-3\mathbf{a}-2\mathbf{b}
\end{aligned}
$$

Reorder the terms to match their vector names. Since $\mathbf{a}$ and $\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, their coefficients are unique. Matching coefficients gives $\lambda=-3$ and $\mu=-2$."] [:db/add "6adb066b-ffdb-5044-8b11-d0799ecdd208" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "6adb066b-ffdb-5044-8b11-d0799ecdd208" :question/answer-fields "a779b0a7-8425-5967-bfea-53aaa14a0f77"] [:db/add "6adb066b-ffdb-5044-8b11-d0799ecdd208" :question/answer-fields "62e0303d-0d43-5fec-8fff-251b531d13be"] [:db/ensure "6adb066b-ffdb-5044-8b11-d0799ecdd208" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096652 :knowledge-point/questions "6adb066b-ffdb-5044-8b11-d0799ecdd208"] [:db/add "93bfe3a4-9df7-5eef-89f1-f7e86f962fef" :answer/id #uuid "93bfe3a4-9df7-5eef-89f1-f7e86f962fef"] [:db/add "93bfe3a4-9df7-5eef-89f1-f7e86f962fef" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "93bfe3a4-9df7-5eef-89f1-f7e86f962fef" :answer/value "-\frac{3}{2}"] [:db/ensure "93bfe3a4-9df7-5eef-89f1-f7e86f962fef" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ec569f7b-5b15-5ad1-80d0-44ce6ac4d4bb" :answer-field/id #uuid "ec569f7b-5b15-5ad1-80d0-44ce6ac4d4bb"] [:db/add "ec569f7b-5b15-5ad1-80d0-44ce6ac4d4bb" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "ec569f7b-5b15-5ad1-80d0-44ce6ac4d4bb" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "ec569f7b-5b15-5ad1-80d0-44ce6ac4d4bb" :answer-field/choices "93bfe3a4-9df7-5eef-89f1-f7e86f962fef"] [:db/add "ec569f7b-5b15-5ad1-80d0-44ce6ac4d4bb" :answer-field/correct "93bfe3a4-9df7-5eef-89f1-f7e86f962fef"] [:db/ensure "ec569f7b-5b15-5ad1-80d0-44ce6ac4d4bb" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "0a6cb272-044d-5cac-ac46-5ed74064cfbd" :answer/id #uuid "0a6cb272-044d-5cac-ac46-5ed74064cfbd"] [:db/add "0a6cb272-044d-5cac-ac46-5ed74064cfbd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0a6cb272-044d-5cac-ac46-5ed74064cfbd" :answer/value "1"] [:db/ensure "0a6cb272-044d-5cac-ac46-5ed74064cfbd" :answer/validate] [:db/add "63a858fa-0e34-566a-bfa8-898b3ebd1765" :answer-field/id #uuid "63a858fa-0e34-566a-bfa8-898b